asus-control-center (1.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security Center: a read-only security overview (Overview, Firewall,
    Boot & Kernel, Applications, Privacy, Tools) with Secure/Warning/
    Critical/Unknown/Unsupported status, details and last-checked time.
  * Opt-in security scans (ClamAV, Lynis, rkhunter, chkrootkit, AIDE) with
    confirmation, timeout, cancel and a retention-capped history. Scans are
    read-only: no auto-install, no quarantine, no file deletion.
  * Three-layer scrolling depth effect: a subtle parallax background, normal
    content scroll and card entrance, respecting the reduced-motion
    preference, with on/off and intensity settings.
  * Diagnostics cards use the shared accent-badge header.
  * Fix missing cpu/memory symbolic icons on Fedora Adwaita.

 -- Mostafa Momen <mostafamomen6521@gmail.com>  Tue, 04 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0300

asus-control-center (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * MyASUS-inspired UI/UX redesign: unified cyan/teal palette, responsive
    dashboard, streamlined navigation, width-clamped pages.
  * System Tools: interactive and safe-by-default — Health, Storage (largest
    folders + cache cleanup with preview/confirm), Processes (searchable,
    sortable, confirmed SIGTERM on the user's own PIDs), Startup manager.
  * Software Center: card-based, read-only, apt/dpkg and dnf/rpm detection.
  * Diagnostics: Passed/Warning/Failed/Unsupported/Not-tested states and a
    Save-report export.
  * New fox logo on a borderless cyan/teal tile.
  * Fix missing cpu/memory symbolic icons on Fedora (GtkImage baseline
    warnings) and a stale version string on the Settings page.

 -- Mostafa Momen <mostafamomen6521@gmail.com>  Tue, 04 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0300

asus-control-center (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * System Manager: health overview, CPU/RAM monitoring, Smart Recommendations,
    Quick Actions, health history.
  * Software Center: installed apps, pending updates, driver and diagnostics.
  * Fix memory leak in health-history directory creation.
  * Fix stale helper exit code on spawn failure.
  * Fix health_history.txt file permissions (0600).
  * Fix dead code in autostart scanner (system entries now counted).

